{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "144", "x": 0.8953504215774838, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.03839282702615196, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Answer:", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.12319506908974809, "w": 0.08997675810559722, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "p1", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.15152541916388573, "w": 0.02749607765157981, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "1.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.17970752416545568, "w": 0.020609553398225476, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Well, I guess one of my best personal traits is that I'm pretty easy-going. I", "x": 0.16774843308549978, "y": 0.17970752416545568, "w": 0.7662724530930395, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "mean, I don't get upset easily and I'm usually able to stay calm even under", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2080378742395933, "w": 0.8260337360410994, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "pressure. Also, people say I'm a good listener, which I think is kind of important,", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.23636822431373095, "w": 0.826591779364659, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "especially when someone just wants to vent or share stuff.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.26469857438786853, "w": 0.5994007877812401, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "2.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.32139637352567824, "w": 0.025044142118860666, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Yeah, I'd say so. My dad is really patient and rarely loses his temper, and I", "x": 0.16774843308549978, "y": 0.32139637352567824, "w": 0.7652088592222682, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "think I've inherited that from him. As for my mum, I definitely take after her in", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3497267990426009, "w": 0.8257069890133234, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "terms of personality. She's super outgoing, maybe even more than I am. So yeah,", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3780571491167385, "w": 0.8259081429726884, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "I guess I've got a bit of both!", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.40638753691226864, "w": 0.2909616153749702, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "3.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4630482747819364, "w": 0.025648859927639937, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Well, for me, honesty is definitely essential. I really value friends who are", "x": 0.16774843308549978, "y": 0.4630482747819364, "w": 0.7654265196991958, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "genuine and speak their mind, even if it's not always what I want to hear. I just", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.49140337008956114, "w": 0.8267248567546976, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "can't stand being lied to. I also think being supportive is a key quality. You know,", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5197337201636988, "w": 0.8259464873054115, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "someone I can truly count on when things get tough, not just a fair-weather friend", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5480641079592289, "w": 0.8267464895199504, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "who only shows up when life is good.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5763944580333665, "w": 0.3776377235646327, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "4.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6330551959030343, "w": 0.025447283052840438, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Well, I think I do have some of the qualities that make a good leader. For one,", "x": 0.16774843308549978, "y": 0.6330551959030343, "w": 0.7660600213887558, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "I'm quite good at listening and taking other people's opinions into account before", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6612743433120499, "w": 0.826272926758326, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "making decisions, which I think is really essential in leadership. I'm also pretty", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6896046933861876, "w": 0.8258160755641718, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "organized and goal-oriented. Having said that, I still have a lot to learn, like how to", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7179351189031102, "w": 0.8265690188249143, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "handle conflicts better or motivate people in tough situations.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7462654689772478, "w": 0.6312996329709178, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "p2", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8029261691255231, "w": 0.0321322432470145, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "OK, I'm going talk about a time when I had a really long but interesting discussion", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8312565191996607, "w": 0.826251396518027, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "with my friends about a news story about artificial intelligence. It was about how", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8596116899500704, "w": 0.8267104007362112, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Al was being used to replace some human jobs, especially in areas like teaching.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8879420400242081, "w": 0.81940016648002, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}